  "lineage": "Ecstatic devotional drumming and dance at Sufi shrines of Pakistan, above all the evening dhamal at the shrine of Lal Shahbaz Qalandar in Sehwan Sharif, Sindh, and the Thursday-night gatherings at the shrine of Shah Jamal in Lahore. Dhol and naqqara drums drive devotees into whirling, head-tossing dance, with chanted invocations of the saint. The naqareh card, in its large naqqar-khana size, stands in for the shrine naqqara kettledrums.",
